The following ideas and formulas are taken from that project and must keep
the copyright notice above:

  - Reading providerData.rawUsage (credit, prompt_tokens, prompt_cache_hit_tokens,
    completion_tokens) and providerData.model from ~/.workbuddy/projects/*/*.jsonl
  - Uncached input tokens = prompt_tokens - prompt_cache_hit_tokens (or 0 if
    prompt_tokens is not greater)
  - Using session_usage.credit_json in workbuddy.db as a ledger when per-call
    detail is missing
  - Grouping credit by the call's own timestamp, not by the session's first day

